      <td class="p-3 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700"><strong>Independencia Lineal (L.I.)</strong><br>de $S = \{\vec{v}_1, \dots, \vec{v}_k\}$</td>
      <td class="p-3 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700">Homogéneo<br>$A \vec{\alpha} = \vec{0}_V$</td>
      <td class="p-3 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700"><strong class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">Compatible Determinado</strong><br>(Solución única: $\vec{\alpha} = \vec{0}$)</td>
      <td class="p-3 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700">$\operatorname{rango}(A) = k$ (número de vectores)<br>Sin variables libres.<br>Si $k=n$: $\det(A) \neq 0$.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="p-3 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700"><strong>Dependencia Lineal (L.D.)</strong><br>de $S = \{\vec{v}_1, \dots, \vec{v}_k\}$</td>
      <td class="p-3 border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700">Homogéneo<br>$A \vec{\alpha} = \vec{0}_V$</td>
